BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 359.55 Tm (Step: 1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 344.32 Tm (Title: Pre-qualify before you hunt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 329.10 Tm (Action: Send the lender a personal financial statement and a management resume to get a bank letter of support.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.87 Tm (Detail: Peterson produces a buyer pre-qualification letter within 24 hours. It needs only a personal financial statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 298.65 Tm (\(SBA Form 413 or any template, ballpark figures accepted\) plus a resume. That letter becomes your hunting license) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 283.42 Tm (with brokers and sellers [JackQuisitions - I6M8wAaqm5s @ 00:36:56].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 268.20 Tm (Step: 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.97 Tm (Title: Get the note size greenlit by the lender) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.75 Tm (Action: Before pitching the seller, ask the lender what note percentage and standby terms they will accept on this) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 222.52 Tm (specific deal.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 207.30 Tm (Detail: Some banks accept a 5% note on 10-year standby. Riskier deals with customer concentration may need a 10, 15,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 192.07 Tm (or 20 percent note, so get a structure at least initially greenlit before the seller sees it [Evan DiLeonardi | Acquisitions -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.85 Tm (zBzv99U7MyE @ 00:04:40].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 161.62 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 146.40 Tm (Title: Write seller financing into the LOI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 131.17 Tm (Action: Put the seller note amount, standby terms, and repayment terms in the letter of intent rather than waiting for due) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.95 Tm (diligence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.72 Tm (Detail: Kim says to tell the seller on the front end that you expect seller financing. Frame it around the seller's benefits:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 85.50 Tm (tax reasons, a guaranteed return, a faster close, and a bank that wants them to keep a piece of the risk [Josh Kim -) Tj ET
