BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (settles on 60 days plus automatic extensions [PF2SOneLrJ0 @ 00:08:28]. Sam Rosati of SMB Law Group pegs SBA) Tj ET
