BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.15 Tm ($1M of basis with no depreciation, no amortization, and no step-up, that price is allocated across seven asset classes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 138.92 Tm (recovered over 1 to 15 years with goodwill at 15, and that a $1M step-up on 3-year trucks throws off one third per year) Tj ET
