BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (accountant work and vendor agreement, and HMRC watches undervalue transfers [04Uy5gfO_PU @ 00:07:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (Protection mechanics are where the SMB Law Group LLP team gets specific, drawing on 399 deals closed as a firm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (Escrow money moves only on joint instructions or a court order; a holdback on a $4M deal wires $3.5M and keeps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm ($0.5M, which shifts the burden to the seller; and set-off against the seller note is the most common tool [iNOj__jXGpE) Tj ET
